{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01829",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.32,
      "end_seconds": 5.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Uh, sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.44,
      "end_seconds": 12.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.46,
      "end_seconds": 18.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "Well, you know, doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.14,
      "end_seconds": 23.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.57,
      "end_seconds": 42.59,
      "duration_seconds": 17.02,
      "text": "Oh, it's a stiff neck after sleeping badly. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I took the morning off to come in today. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.31,
      "end_seconds": 47.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.42,
      "end_seconds": 51.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "It's been going on for two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.49,
      "end_seconds": 55.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Mm, okay. How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.64,
      "end_seconds": 61.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "It's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.67,
      "end_seconds": 68.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.7,
      "end_seconds": 69.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Severe, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.4,
      "end_seconds": 73.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Is it worse at certain times?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.84,
      "end_seconds": 78.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Yes, uh, turning. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.98,
      "end_seconds": 87.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 87.79,
      "end_seconds": 93.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.15,
      "end_seconds": 96.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.03,
      "end_seconds": 100.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.01,
      "end_seconds": 115.42,
      "duration_seconds": 14.41,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.89,
      "end_seconds": 129.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.41,
      "end_seconds": 137.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes. My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.49,
      "end_seconds": 142.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.13,
      "end_seconds": 156.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.78,
      "text": "Well, I've had an underactive thyroid, yes. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.67,
      "end_seconds": 159.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.06,
      "end_seconds": 188.15,
      "duration_seconds": 28.09,
      "text": "Yes, an irregular heartbeat. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I've never really been one for hospitals. I've, I've had high blood pressure, yes. I've had heart disease, yes. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.58,
      "end_seconds": 195.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Alright, an underactive thyroid and an irregular heartbeat, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.77,
      "end_seconds": 209.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.87,
      "end_seconds": 220.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "I take Eltroxin, 100 micrograms, every morning. I take warfarin, in the evening for the blood thinning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.66,
      "end_seconds": 224.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.85,
      "end_seconds": 243.92,
      "duration_seconds": 18.07,
      "text": "3 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. I'm on metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my pressure. Aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 245.8,
      "end_seconds": 255.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "Mm, it's meant to be once a day, though I don't see she take it every time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.64,
      "end_seconds": 260.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.18,
      "end_seconds": 267.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "I had two stents put in my heart three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.26,
      "end_seconds": 271.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Alright, do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.99,
      "end_seconds": 276.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.06,
      "end_seconds": 279.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Right, what about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.43,
      "end_seconds": 288.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.89,
      "end_seconds": 293.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Alright, do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 294.85,
      "end_seconds": 298.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.64,
      "end_seconds": 301.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "What about head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.08,
      "end_seconds": 305.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any head injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.3,
      "end_seconds": 310.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, headache or arm numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.23,
      "end_seconds": 326.75,
      "duration_seconds": 15.52,
      "text": "No, no fever, no headache, no arm numbness. I did have tightness between my shoulders at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.02,
      "end_seconds": 329.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.78,
      "end_seconds": 333.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.17,
      "end_seconds": 342.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.92,
      "end_seconds": 355.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.77,
      "end_seconds": 379.6,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.6 degrees, heart rate 83, respiratory rate 17. And blood pressure 124 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.55,
      "end_seconds": 382.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.94,
      "end_seconds": 387.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.05,
      "end_seconds": 393.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.43,
      "end_seconds": 397.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.35,
      "end_seconds": 414.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "The neck muscles on the left are tight and the movements are full."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.53,
      "end_seconds": 426.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Having listened and examined, this looks most like a simple neck muscle strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.7,
      "end_seconds": 431.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.08,
      "end_seconds": 447.51,
      "duration_seconds": 14.43,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a simple neck muscle strain, and we'll watch how it goes. Heat, gentle neck rolls, and a supportive pillow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 447.8,
      "end_seconds": 453.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Hm, okay. Let's plan a check if not better in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 454.96,
      "end_seconds": 458.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I can put that appointment in for you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 458.85,
      "end_seconds": 462.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 464.57,
      "end_seconds": 469.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Okay, so great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 471.45,
      "end_seconds": 472.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}